# Core: everything the Phase 0 eval harness and leakage test need, and nothing
# more. Kept tiny on purpose so CI installs in seconds and `make leakage` is
# cheap enough to run after every data change, as CLAUDE.md requires.
#
# NO model libraries here. torch/transformers/faiss live in requirements-ml.in.

